  "cuisine": "general",
  "note": "THE SPEEDBOAT PASS. This is not a cuisine - it is a cross-check. Cuisine lists miss venues that straddle two cuisines: Speedboat Bar is filed Thai-Chinese, so no Thai list carries it, while Time Out ranked it the FOURTH best restaurant in London. General rankings are the only source type that sees those venues. Run this after every cuisine pass and treat each unmatched name as either a missing row or a missing cuisine. Scope is set to awards on the ranking sources so the table-and-list harvesting path applies - Top 100s do not use headings. Known-blocked domains omitted. Every URL came from a search result.",
